    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_20051221.0053\n\nLONDON, Dec 21 , 2005\n\nEuropean stocks rise at open: FTSE 100 up 0.34 percent\n\n\n\n\nEuropean stock markets climbed in opening deals on Wednesday, with London's FTSE 100 index up 0.34 percent at 5,566.8 points.\n\nFrankfurt's DAX 30 index rose 0.2 percent to 5,367.8 points and in Paris the CAC 40 gained 0.12 percent to 4,709.1.",
